sequenceDiagram
  participant Sensors
  participant Mobile
  participant API
  participant Maps as Map Provider
  actor User
  Sensors->>Mobile: Noisy location updates
  Mobile->>Mobile: Accuracy, hysteresis, dwell check
  Mobile->>API: Request localization / route progress
  API-->>Mobile: Persistent deviation confirmed or uncertain
  alt Persistent deviation with reliable position
    Mobile->>API: POST /v1/routes/walking
    API->>Maps: Request replacement pedestrian route
    Maps-->>API: New route or error
    API-->>Mobile: Validated route
    Mobile-->>User: Announce reroute or explicit failure
  else Uncertain position
    Mobile-->>User: GPS guidance and safe relocalization prompt
  end
